  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0: invalidated transitions are immutable history (re-requests create new transitions); first-class approver-group persistence (ApproverGroupId scalar + PAFGroupResolver hook); native Replace/Reissue/InvalidateRole/InvalidateAll; enum role overloads; richer query extensions; bulk metadata access; UTC timestamps via PAFClock; nullable annotations. Configurable action policy — WithPolicy(PAFActionPolicy) gates Reset/Replace/Reissue/Invalidate/Approve/Reject by the target transition's decision state (per-action allowed-state matrix; presets Default and DecisionIsFinal); violations throw PAFActionNotAllowedException (derives from InvalidOperationException); the default policy preserves the pre-policy behavior exactly, including the re-decide fallback; multi-transition actions (ResetTransitions, InvalidateRole, InvalidateAll) validate atomically before mutating. New transition-targeted overloads Invalidate(Guid), Reissue(Guid), Replace(Guid, newApprover) act on exactly the identified row (group rows reissue to the same group). Multi-targets netstandard2.0, net8.0, and net10.0.",
